            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Kageyama: What’s the other 98% of 2% milk?\nHinata: I’m terrified of Natsu being taller than me one day\nTsukishima: Time is an illusion and the only thing that remains a constant is my disdain for everyone around me\nYamaguchi: I’ve been a part of this fucking team for nearly a year and I never remembered what anyone’s name is and at this point i’m too afraid to ask\nDaichi: How come Hinata cycles for like 2 hours a day and his legs are scrawny but I do nothing and my thighs are tree trunks\nSugawara: What if they find the bodies\nAsahi: Somebody asked me what time it was and I panicked and said “Yes it is” and walked away\nNishinoya: How can Despacito have more youtube hits than there are people on the internet?\nEnnoshita: I realised the other day that I’ve literally never talked to Asahi once\nTanaka: Takeda-sensei kinda looks like the old Date Tech captain\nKuroo: I should grow a beard\nKenma: Kuroo saw me reading hentai once and instead of judging me he keeps buying me doujins and I want it to stop\nYaku: It’s been eighteen minutes since Lev said something stupid and I’m worried that he’s holding something really, really dumb back\nLev: Why do I have grey hair at 16 am I gonna go bald too jesus christ\nIwaizumi: Mattsun and Makki keep talking about ‘Trolleyball’ and keep asking other clubs if they have anything flat with wheels. I’m concerned.\nOikawa: I want to play against Iwaizumi for once so I can see his happy trail more every time he spikes\nMattsun: I’m convinced I saw Oikawa wearing panties the other day\nMakki: I wonder if the pink hair dye would sting trying to make the carpets match the drapes\nBokuto: Has anyone really been far even as decided to use even go want to do look more like?\nAkaashi: Was I always this gay\nTendou: The only reason I didn’t kill a kid who made fun of Ushijima is because Semi was there and he just happens to have a better understanding of our legal system than I do\nUshijima: Why is my team so stupid I thought I was a good captain",
